  "text": "\r\n\t\t Polling Locations / Hours | Concord, NH - Official Website \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Services   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Business   \t\t\t \n     How To   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment \nElections / Voter Info \nPolling Locations / Hours \r\nPolling Locations / Hours\t\t \r\nWards & Polling Locations \nResidents within the City are assigned a polling location based on where they reside. To find out what ward you live in and where you should vote please view our voting ward street listing. \nPolling Locations (PDF)  - Polls within the City of Concord are open from 7:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. on Election Day. \nVoting Ward Street Listing (PDF) \nWard Map (PDF) \nPlease contact the  City Clerk’s Office  with any questions. \r\n\t\t\t Absentee Voting Information \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\n\t\t\t Polling Locations / Hours \r\n\t\t\t Return of Votes \r\n\t\t\t Sample Ballots \r\n\t\t\t Voter ID Information \r\n\t\t\t Ward Map \r\n\t\t\t Ward Official Roles \r\n\t\t\t Online Bill Services  \n& Property Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Report a Concern \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n\t\t\t Concord Maps \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\n\t\t\t City Manager's  \nNewsletter \r\nContact Us \r\nConcord City Hall \n41 Green Street  \nConcord, NH 03301 \r\nPhone:   603-225-8610 \r\nContact us \r\nPopular Links \r\n         City Council \n         Library \n         Parks & Recreation \n         Public Works \n         Street Closures \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Accessibility \n         Photo Credits \n         Privacy Policy \n         Site Map \n         Terms & Conditions \n         Translate Our Website \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
